test.yaml:6:15: "action/checkout" looks like a typo of the popular action "actions/checkout", which belongs to another account. a typosquatted account can serve malicious code. check the name; to accept it as is, add "action/checkout" to the "allow" option of the "typosquat-uses" rule [typosquat-uses]
test.yaml:7:15: "dokcer/login-action" looks like a typo of the popular action "docker/login-action", which belongs to another account. a typosquatted account can serve malicious code. check the name; to accept it as is, add "dokcer/login-action" to the "allow" option of the "typosquat-uses" rule [typosquat-uses]
